{"id":"06-specs","number":6,"slug":"writing-specs-for-agents","title":"Specs agents can execute","short":"Specs agents can execute","module":"Working with one agent","summary":"A coding agent fills every gap in your request with its best guess, drawn from average code on the internet. A good spec closes the gaps that matter: the goal, what done looks like, the constraints and what's out of scope. Here's how to write one, without writing it yourself.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Every request you give an agent has gaps. The agent will fill every one of them. The question is whether you choose what goes there, or the internet does.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 6","module":"Module 2 · Working with one agent","title":"Specs agents can *execute*","subtitle":"Close the gaps that matter. Leave the rest to the agent.","bubble":"What did you mean by “nice”?","mood":"think"},"start":0.5,"dur":10.447,"words":[{"text":"Every","s":0.8,"e":1.12},{"text":"request","s":1.36,"e":1.6},{"text":"you","s":1.68,"e":1.76},{"text":"give","s":1.84,"e":1.92},{"text":"an","s":1.96,"e":2},{"text":"agent","s":2.08,"e":2.48},{"text":"has","s":2.6,"e":2.72},{"text":"gaps.","s":2.8,"e":3.68},{"text":"The","s":3.76,"e":3.84},{"text":"agent","s":4.04,"e":4.24},{"text":"will","s":4.32,"e":4.4},{"text":"fill","s":4.48,"e":4.72},{"text":"every","s":4.8,"e":5.12},{"text":"one","s":5.2,"e":5.28},{"text":"of","s":5.36,"e":5.44},{"text":"them.","s":5.52,"e":6.08},{"text":"The","s":6.16,"e":6.24},{"text":"question","s":6.44,"e":6.64},{"text":"is","s":6.72,"e":6.96},{"text":"whether","s":7.12,"e":7.28},{"text":"you","s":7.36,"e":7.52},{"text":"choose","s":7.6,"e":7.76},{"text":"what","s":7.84,"e":8},{"text":"goes","s":8.04,"e":8.24},{"text":"there,","s":8.32,"e":8.853},{"text":"or","s":8.907,"e":8.96},{"text":"the","s":9,"e":9.04},{"text":"internet","s":9.12,"e":9.44},{"text":"does.","s":9.52,"e":10.08}]},{"template":"quote","chapter":"Gaps get filled","narratio