9},{"text":"goals","s":96.559,"e":96.959},{"text":"and","s":96.999,"e":97.039},{"text":"constraints,","s":97.119,"e":97.999},{"text":"and","s":98.079,"e":98.159},{"text":"leave","s":98.279,"e":98.399},{"text":"the","s":98.439,"e":98.479},{"text":"low-level","s":98.639,"e":99.039},{"text":"decisions","s":99.159,"e":99.599},{"text":"to","s":99.639,"e":99.679},{"text":"the","s":99.759,"e":99.839},{"text":"agent.","s":99.919,"e":100.559}]},{"template":"statement","chapter":"Constraints matter","narration":"Constraints are the gaps that bite hardest. When Cursor's Wilson Lin pointed thousands of agents at building a web browser, they pulled in existing parsers and a JavaScript engine. That wasn't misbehavior. His instructions never said what to build from scratch.","params":{"eyebrow":"Cursor's agent swarm built a browser","text":"The agents pulled in dependencies, because the spec *never said not to*.","sub":"Wilson Lin: an omission in the instructions, not agent misbehavior.","art":"box","tone":"bad","sync":false},"start":101.17,"dur":16.832,"words":[{"text":"Constraints","s":101.47,"e":102.157},{"text":"are","s":102.19,"e":102.323},{"text":"the","s":102.35,"e":102.417},{"text":"gaps","s":102.43,"e":102.91},{"text":"that","s":102.99,"e":103.07},{"text":"bite","s":103.23,"e":103.47},{"text":"hardest.","s":103.55,"e":104.39},{"text":"When","s":104.67,"e":104.83},{"text":"Cursor's","s":104.91,"e":105.31},{"text":"Wilson","s":105.39,"e":105.71},{"text":"Lin","s":105.79,"e":106.11},{"text":"pointed","s":106.23,"e":106.59},{"text":"thousands","s":106.67,"e":107.07},{"text":"of","s":107.11,"e":107.15},{"text":"agents","s":107.23,"e":107.55},{"text":"at","s":107.63,"e":107.71},{"text":"building","s":107.83,"e":107.95},{"text":"a","s":108.03,"e":108.07},{"text":"web","s":108.11,"e":108.27},{"text":"browser,","s":108.35,"e":109.15},{"text":"they","s":109.23,"e":109.31},{"text":"pulled","s":109.39,"e":109.55},{"text":"in","s":109.63,"e":109.71},{"text":"existing","s":109.95,"e":1